    "text": "EFFECTIVE DATE: January 1, 1994"
  },
  {
    "id": "c004",
    "name": "Article I — Application of Agreement",
    "text": "ARTICLE I APPLICATION OF AGREEMENT. This agreement applies to the Commercial General Liability,. Hospital Professional Liability, Automobile Liability, Non-Owned Aircraft Liability and Heliport Liability coverages under the REINSURED’S excess liability policies written on an occurrence or a claims made basis to apply excess of underlying insurance which afford Aimits not less than the limits specified in the following Schedule of Underlying Limits as respects ioss under policies becoming effective on or after the effective date and prior to the termination date of this agreement."
  },
  {
    "id": "c005",
    "name": "ARTICLE I — Schedule of Underlying Limits",
    "text": "SCHEDULE. OF UNDERLYING LIMITS General Liability $1,000,000 each occurrence, $1,000,000 annual aggregate combined single limit Hospital Professional $1,000,000 each medical incident, Liability $3,000,000 annual aggregate Automobile Liability As respects Bodily Injury Liability and Property Damage Liability combined subject to a single Limit: $1,000,000 each occurrence Aircraft Liability As respects Bodily Injury (Non—owned only) Liability and Property Damage Liability combined subject to @ single iimit: (a) Non-—-owneda Aircraft — $10,000,000 each occurrence {D) Heliport Liability $5,000,000 each coccurrence"
  },
  {
    "id": "c006",
    "name": "ARTICLE I — Discovery Period Coverage",
    "text": "Any Giscovery period coverage or extended reporting endorsement attaching to a policy ceded hereunder shall be considered as part of the period of said policy, subject to the provision that a separete Limit of liability may apply in respect thereof."
