 {"clause_id": "c006", "issues": [
   {"issue": "\"[S]ubject to the provision that a separate Limit of liability may apply in respect thereof\" is permissive and unspecified: it does not say whose limit, when it applies, or whether a fresh reinsurance limit is created for the discovery/extended reporting period. That directly bears on how much the reinsurer owes.", "type": 1, "prob": 0.45},
