   {"issue": "Amendment No. 1 and Amendment No. 4 each purport to delete Article III outright while applying only to policies effective on or after July 1, 1995 and October 1, 1996 respectively, so which limit ($10M or $25M) governs 1994–1996 cessions is unresolved.", "type": 2, "prob": 0.28}
 ]},
 {"clause_id": "c010", "issues": [
